WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:04.000
Across media, health, security, and agriculture, we ask one shared question.

00:00:04.100 --> 00:00:08.000
First, observe signals from more than one source.

00:00:08.100 --> 00:00:12.000
Then account for context, uncertainty, and change.

00:00:12.100 --> 00:00:16.000
Make the evidence behind a decision easier to examine.

00:00:16.100 --> 00:00:19.800
Signal, context, and a more trustworthy decision.
